		{
			dependencies: ["75B7246A1B0C350B"]
			description: [
				"&c&lAge VII · Realms Beyond.&r Your sky island is not the only world - but the old doors are sealed, and space holds every key."
				""
				"&7The Twilight Forest&r opens to those who have walked the &eMoon&r - a Desh Ingot lights its pool now, not a diamond."
				"&7The Undergarden&r demands a catalyst cored with &eMars&r ostrum."
				"&7The Everbright&r ignites only with a lighter forged from &eVenus&r calorite."
				""
				"One planet, one realm. Climb the solar system and the dimensions fall open behind you. Their bosses guard the metals your fission reactor will demand."
			]
			icon: "minecraft:ender_pearl"
			id: "7EF5DDBB65C58DDC"
			rewards: [{
				id: "0B10E0765D673687"
