		{
			dependencies: ["7EF5DDBB65C58DDC"]
			description: [
				"Fill a 2x2 pool with water, ring it with flowers/grass - and toss in a &eDesh Ingot&r. In this pack, moon metal opens the Twilight, not diamonds."
				""
				"&cThe portal stays dead until you have set foot on the Moon&r - the forest only answers to those who've left the sky."
				""
				"A whole shadowed overworld of dungeons and a strict boss order awaits. Its Fiery Ingots are the only metal your fission reactor accepts."
			]
			icon: "twilightforest:twilight_portal_miniature_structure"
			id: "67BC6ABF61224134"
			rewards: [{
				count: 16
				id: "2EB10EA25CB53217"
