		{
			dependencies: ["10583B7DED57F345"]
			description: [
				"In the Labyrinth beneath the swamp waits the &6Minoshroom&r. Slay it - the Mazebreaker pickaxe is your key deeper in."
				""
				"&e&lThe Labyrinth is the real obstacle, not the boss.&r It is a huge underground maze full of minotaurs, and the walls resist ordinary tools. The Minoshroom sits in a chamber at its heart."
				""
				"&e&lThe fight:&r a minotaur that charges in straight lines like the Naga but hits far harder, in a confined room with no space to retreat."
				"&7- &fSidestep the charge&7 - it commits to a direction and cannot correct."
				"&7- &fIt heals from nearby mushrooms.&7 Break them before engaging."
				"&7- &fBring milk or a cleansing option&7 - it inflicts hunger and nausea."
				""
				"&e&lThe drop that matters is the &7Meef Stroganoff&e and the Diamond Minotaur Axe&r, but progression-wise this kill unlocks the &7Mazebreaker&r - the only pickaxe that breaks Maze Stone quickly, and the tool you need before the Dark Tower."
				""
				"&8Map as you go or bring blocks to mark turns. The Labyrinth genuinely will get you lost, and dying deep inside means a long walk back to your gravestone."
			]
			icon: "twilightforest:minoshroom_trophy"
			id: "0DABDEE4D0A6CA1A"
			rewards: [{
				count: 6
				id: "7F00AAAA00000001"
				item: "twilightforest:steeleaf_ingot"
				type: "item"
			}]
			shape: "diamond"
			subtitle: "&7Labyrinth, under the maze"
