		}
		{
			dependencies: ["7F00000000000001"]
			description: [
				"The Goblin Knight Stronghold is ruled by the &7Knight Phantom&r - armoured ghosts on spectral steeds. Break them for Knightmetal."
				""
				"&c&lThis kill unlocks Draconic Evolution.&r The &bDraconium Core&r - the root of the entire Draconic tree and therefore all of Act IV - is now pinned with &7Knightmetal Ingots&r. No Knight Phantom, no Draconic."
				""
				"&e&lThe fight:&r several armoured phantoms that phase in and out, fight from the air, and hit hard with lances."
				"&7- &fThey are invulnerable while transparent.&7 Wait for them to solidify."
				"&7- &fThey fight in a sealed trophy room&7 - no retreating, so bring supplies in with you."
				"&7- &fThey come in waves.&7 Heal between them."
				"&7- &fRanged is awkward&7 because of the phasing. Melee on the ground when they descend."
				""
				"&e&lDrops:&r &7Knightmetal Ingots&r and &7Armor Shards&r - Knightmetal armour and tools are excellent, and Knightmetal is now a hard requirement for Draconic. Plus the Knight Phantom Trophy."
				""
				"&8Getting in requires clearing the Goblin Stronghold, which is a dungeon in its own right. Bring building blocks - the mazes are easier to cheat through than to solve."
			]
			icon: "twilightforest:knight_phantom_trophy"
			id: "57369136D708C9BF"
			rewards: [{
				count: 6
				id: "7F00AAAA00000002"
				item: "twilightforest:knightmetal_ingot"
				type: "item"
			}]
