		{
			dependencies: ["7F00000000000002"]
			description: [
				"Atop the Dark Tower floats the &4Ur-Ghast&r, weeping fire. Bring a Lamp of Cinders and nerves of steel."
				""
				"&c&lCelestial Core component number four.&r Keep the trophy - without it the pack has no ending."
				""
				"&e&lThe fight:&r a giant ghast that hovers above an open tower roof, rains fireballs, and summons smaller ghasts constantly."
				"&7- &fReflect its fireballs&7 back at it. That is the primary damage source - your bow will not carry this alone."
				"&7- &fIt periodically retreats to the ceiling&7 and becomes untargetable while it heals. Kill the adds during that window."
				"&7- &fBring blocks.&7 The arena is open to a very long fall and the ghasts will knock you off it."
				"&7- &fFire resistance again.&7 Everything here is fire."
				""
				"&e&lGetting there is half the fight.&r The Dark Tower is full of ghast traps and locked block-puzzle doors. A &7Lamp of Cinders&r clears the thorns on the approach; the tower's coloured key-blocks are opened by killing the tower's mini-bosses."
				""
				"&e&lDrops:&r &7Carminite&r, &7Fiery Tears&r, and the &7Ur-Ghast Trophy&r."
				""
				"&8This is the hardest Twilight boss before the Snow Queen. Come with the best gear you own and a stack of golden apples."
			]
			icon: "twilightforest:ur_ghast_trophy"
			id: "25B739B6205C0331"
