		{
			dependencies: ["7F00000000000003"]
			description: [
				"Deep in the Snowy Forest, the &fAlpha Yeti&r guards its lair. Beat it to brave the frozen peaks above."
				""
				"&c&lThis is the gate to the Snow Queen&r - and the Snow Queen's trophy is the fifth and last piece of the Celestial Core. You cannot finish the pack without coming through here."
				""
				"&e&lThe fight:&r a large yeti in a cave lair that grabs you, carries you into the air and throws you."
				"&7- &fThe grab is the whole fight.&7 It picks you up, climbs, and drops you - the fall is what kills people, not the melee."
				"&7- &fFight near the floor&7 and keep something soft or a water bucket below you."
				"&7- &fIt is fast&7 - do not plan on outrunning it in a confined lair."
				""
				"&e&lDrops:&r &7Alpha Yeti Fur&r, which crafts into &7Arctic Armour&r - the gear that keeps you alive in the Glacier biome above. That biome is where the Aurora Palace and the Snow Queen are."
				""
				"&7So the order is: Alpha Yeti, then Arctic Armour, then the Glacier, then the Snow Queen. Skipping the armour means freezing to death on the approach.&r"
				""
				"&8Take fall-damage protection if you have it. Free Runners, a Draconic shield, or feather falling all turn the yeti's signature move into an inconvenience."
			]
			icon: "twilightforest:alpha_yeti_trophy"
